# Local dev environment, not project infrastructure. Every file here is
# specific to one host: docker-compose.yml mounts REDACTED-HOST-PATH/*,
# devcontainer.json and the Dockerfile hardcode /Users/andrewgross/... and a
# uid that matches one account. None of it is usable by anyone cloning this
# repo, and the repo is public. It was committed incidentally in fc61e76 (an
# exp041 commit) rather than by decision.
